WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Your student earned the opportunity. Fragmented follow-through should not put it at risk.

2
00:08.000 --> 00:15.000
After submission, every college becomes its own system. Portals, notices, deadlines, and next steps no family should have to coordinate alone.

3
00:16.000 --> 00:23.000
Campus Passage brings the household one calm plan. What needs attention, what is waiting on a school, and what is complete.

4
00:24.000 --> 00:31.000
Know whose turn it is, without sharing school portal passwords.

5
00:32.000 --> 00:39.000
Official-source cues, applicable terms, and honest unknown states replace guesswork with earned confidence.

6
00:40.000 --> 00:47.000
In-app and email are core, SMS remains future, optional, and consent-based.

7
00:48.000 --> 00:56.000
See Campus Passage in action. Request private-preview access at campuspassage.com.
